      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Run `code/main.py`. Compare the conversation under round-robin vs LLM-selected. Which agent dominates under each?\n2. Add a \"max-speaks-per-agent\" rule in the selector. How does it affect the transcript?\n3. Implement a goal-reached termination: stop when the reviewer returns \"approved.\" How often does it trigger before the round cap?\n4. Read the AutoGen stable docs on GroupChat (https://microsoft.github.io/autogen/stable/user-guide/core-user-guide/design-patterns/group-chat.html). Identify the default selector used by `GroupChatManager`.\n5. Read the AG2 repo (https://github.com/ag2ai/ag2) and compare its v0.2 GroupChat to the v0.4 event-driven version. What concrete property (throughput, fault-tolerance, composability) does v0.4 add?"
      ]
